{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Diving into abyss' is a First-person horror game themed around cave diving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created with a focus on three key elements: The claustrophobia of the cave, limited visibility, and restricted oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to make you feel as though you are actually cave diving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new recruit in a professional civilian diving rescue team with technical diving certification.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a report from the Coast Guard, you are finally heading out on your first rescue mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are extremely nervous, but there's no need to worry because an experienced diver is your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim, explore and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 30min - 60min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125660?t=1761744802","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125660?t=1761744802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125660/ab39447a91a5b4b1ac757ad1964736a96ef5c450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761744802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125660/ab39447a91a5b4b1ac757ad1964736a96ef5c450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761744802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Diving into abyss' is a First-person horror game themed around cave diving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created with a focus on three key elements: The claustrophobia of the cave, limited visibility, and restricted oxygen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to make you feel as though you are actually cave diving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new recruit in a professional civilian diving rescue team with technical diving certification.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a report from the Coast Guard, you are finally heading out on your first rescue mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are extremely nervous, but there's no need to worry because an experienced diver is your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim, explore and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 30min - 60min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Springbok"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125660/b661aee66f177380d6625035ae94e118e5c8ae77/header.jpg?t=1761744802","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125660/115806996/28c524c3476e92cb400a150dd1978b56dcef4854/1761028436/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761744460","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125660/115806996/28c524c3476e92cb400a150dd1978b56dcef4854/1761028436/dash_h264.mpd?t=176174446